+// ANK1402 Italian QZERTY legends from the photographed keyboard. Matrix positions
+// are correlated with KEYTE1's positional diagrams, not BASIC-variant keycaps.
+// PC letters follow their legends (not QZERTY positions); punctuation follows the
+// documented ISO 102-key profile. CLEAR is distinct from ESC and Backspace.
+// Unassigned keys remain available in MAME's input configuration. The dedicated
+// REPEAT input has no verified auxiliary scancode yet and is not synthesized.
+// Natural-keyboard digits and newline use the numeric keypad for ROM/BCOS prompts.
+INPUT_PORTS_START( olivetti_l1_keyboard )
+	PORT_START("K0")
